Z||000001||RossT||05-16-2000||04:02 AM||||I am going to be there. The dates are June 1,2,3,4. The hotel that acts as the headquaters is full, but there are many many hotels close by. Visit the wisconsin fiero site for details. I think its $40 to register a car the day of the show or $35 in advance. If you are not bringing your car, I am not sure if they charge and admission fee.<BR>I am going to make a family thing out of this thus I am bringing the "mini-van", but I will be bringing my digital camera to take pics of all the forum members.<P>see you there!!<BR>Ross<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 05-16-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Old Lar||05-16-2000||08:35 AM||||No admission fee for visiting the car show on Saturday. Look up on the Fiero Fanatics web page for more information.<P>Its been a fun show if you don't mind cleaning off the pine pollen from your shiny car every 10 minutes.<P>You gotta register early for the Chula Vista Resort Hotel.  ||||reg||10
